{"parentUuid":"9f734125-d1b8-4d3e-adaa-29982c4031f4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgv3Y7wr5R2SYgSAGYnFa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The previous and next cards are fixed. Cause: moving the tool pages into `DocumentPage` put them in a main column that isn't a page-width frame, so they ran edge to edge. They now sit in `DocumentPage`'s footer slot, inside a frame, aligned to the reading column with both cards side by side. I checked the Wisp page at desktop width in light theme only. The `orin-dx` format, typecheck, lint, test, build and verify checks all exit 0. The previous/next links are covered only by the `verify` link check, which I did not click through.\n\nI haven't looked at the cards on the other eight tool pages or at phone width. The document design says two cards fit the centre column down to about 480px, so I expect them to stack on a phone, but I haven't seen it.\n\nThe conversion to `DocumentPage` is the cause of this and of the source-note placement issue I mentioned earlier. If anything else on the tool pages looks off after the switch, send a screenshot. The ones I haven't checked are the page footers, the other tools' sections and the mobile chapter menu.\n\nNothing is committed in the pages repo.\n\nresult: Previous and next cards on the tool pages are back inside the page frame, aligned to the reading column via `DocumentPage`'s footer slot, with `orin-dx` format, typecheck, lint, test, build and verify all exit 0, uncommitted in `~/projects/pages`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":608,"cache_read_input_tokens":660158,"output_tokens":456,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":608,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"