pointer]:\n              - /url: \"#features-heading\"\n              - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e76]: \"06\"\n          - listitem [ref=f147e78]:\n            - link \"support\" [ref=f147e79] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: \"#support-heading\"\n              - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e80]: \"07\"\n          - listitem [ref=f147e82]:\n            - link \"the family\" [ref=f147e83] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: \"#works-heading\"\n              - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e84]: \"08\"\n          - listitem [ref=f147e86]:\n            - link \"next\" [ref=f147e87] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: \"#roadmap-heading\"\n              - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e88]: \"09\"\n        - link \"Back to top\" [ref=f147e90] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: \"#top\"\n      - main [ref=f147e91]:\n        - region \"Why Lumen\" [ref=f147e92]:\n          - generic [ref=f147e93]:\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e94]: \"{\"\n            - generic [ref=f147e95]: the job\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e96]: \"}\"\n          - heading \"Why Lumen\" [level=2] [ref=f147e97]\n          - generic [ref=f147e99]:\n            - generic [ref=f147e100]:\n              - generic [ref=f147e101]:\n                - generic [ref=f147e102]: the problem\n                - paragraph [ref=f147e103]: Coding agents already log every turn, tool call and token. Each one writes a different format.\n              - generic [ref=f147e104]:\n                - generic [ref=f147e105]: what it does\n                - paragraph [ref=f147e106]: Lumen reads those logs and tells you what a session cost, whether the prompt cache worked and where the agent went in circles.\n            - paragraph [ref=f147e107]: It’s the observe step in Orin DX. Prism checks a change against what Lumen sees. Wisp holds the context that change edits.\n          - complementary [ref=f147e108]:\n            - generic [ref=f147e110]:\n              - generic [ref=f147e111]: see also\n              - link \"Measure, learn, improve\" [ref=f147e122] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /principles/#improve\n        - region \"Get Lumen\" [ref=f147e123]:\n          - generic [ref=f147e124]:\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e125]: \"{\"\n            - generic [ref=f147e126]: get it\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e127]: \"}\"\n          - heading \"Get Lumen\" [level=2] [ref=f147e128]\n          - paragraph [ref=f147e129]: Build from source with a current stable Rust toolchain. The lumen-cli crate on crates.io is a different project.\n          - list \"Install steps\" [ref=f147e133]:\n            - listitem [ref=f147e134]:\n              - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e136]: \"01\"\n              - generic [ref=f147e138]:\n                - code [ref=f147e139]:\n                  - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e140]: $\n                  - text: git clone https://github.com/orin-dx/lumen.git && cd lumen\n                - button \"Copy command\" [ref=f147e141] [cursor=pointer]\n                - status [ref=f147e145]\n            - listitem [ref=f147e146]:\n              - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e148]: \"02\"\n              - generic [ref=f147e150]:\n                - code [ref=f147e151]:\n                  - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e152]: $\n                  - text: cargo build --release --workspace\n                - button \"Copy command\" [ref=f147e153] [cursor=pointer]\n                - status [ref=f147e157]\n            - listitem [ref=f147e158]:\n              - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e160]: \"03\"\n              - generic [ref=f147e162]:\n                - code [ref=f147e163]:\n                  - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e164]: $\n                  - text: ./target/release/lumen --help\n                - button \"Copy command\" [ref=f147e165] [cursor=pointer]\n                - status [ref=f147e169]\n        - region \"One session, two views\" [ref=f147e170]:\n          - generic [ref=f147e171]:\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e172]: \"{\"\n            - generic [ref=f147e173]: see it\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e174]: \"}\"\n          - heading \"One session, two views\" [level=2] [ref=f147e175]\n          - paragraph [ref=f147e176]: A six-turn test session. The dollar figures show the arithmetic, not a typical session.\n          - generic [ref=f147e178]:\n            - 'figure \"lumen audit: tokens by cache tier, cost and the no-cache baseline Copy lumen audit: tokens by cache tier, cost and the no-cache baseline\" [ref=f147e179]':\n              - generic [ref=f147e180]:\n                - 'generic \"lumen audit: tokens by cache tier, cost and the no-cache baseline\" [ref=f147e185]'\n                - generic [ref=f147e187]:\n                  - 'button \"Copy lumen audit: tokens by cache tier, cost and the no-cache baseline\" [ref=f147e188] [cursor=pointer]'\n                  - status [ref=f147e194]\n              - 'region \"lumen audit: tokens by cache tier, cost and the no-cache baseline (scrolls)\" [ref=f147e195]':\n                - 'group \"lumen audit: tokens by cache tier, cost and the no-cache baseline\" [ref=f147e196]':\n                  - code [ref=f147e197]: \"Token Economics & Cache Audit: a1b2c3d4-1234-4567-89ab-1234567890ab Model: claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022 ╭─────────────────────────────┬─────────╮ │ Metric ┆ Value │ ╞═════════════════════════════╪═════════╡ │ Uncached Input Tokens ┆ 39200 │ │ Cache Creation (5m Write) ┆ 2500 │ │ Cache Creation (1h Write) ┆ 0 │ │ Cache Read (0.10x Discount) ┆ 140000 │ │ Output Tokens ┆ 270 │ │ Reasoning Tokens ┆ 0 │ │ Cache Hit Ratio ┆ 77.1% │ │ Actual USD Spend ┆ $0.1730 │ │ Baseline Cost (No Cache) ┆ $0.5492 │ │ Net Savings USD ┆ $0.3761 │ │ Efficiency Multiplier ┆ 3.17x │ ╰─────────────────────────────┴─────────╯\"\n            - 'figure \"lumen trace: turn by turn, with tool calls and token counters Copy lumen trace: turn by turn, with tool calls and token counters\" [ref=f147e198]':\n              - generic [ref=f147e199]:\n                - 'generic \"lumen trace: turn by turn, with tool calls and token counters\" [ref=f147e204]'\n                - generic [ref=f147e206]:\n                  - 'button \"Copy lumen trace: turn by turn, with tool calls and token counters\" [ref=f147e207] [cursor=pointer]'\n                  - status [ref=f147e213]\n              - 'region \"lumen trace: turn by turn, with tool calls and token counters (scrolls)\" [ref=f147e214]':\n                - 'group \"lumen trace: turn by turn, with tool calls and token counters\" [ref=f147e215]':\n                  - code [ref=f147e216]: \"Session Trajectory: a1b2c3d4-1234-4567-89ab-1234567890ab Orchestrator: ClaudeCode | Model: claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022 Turns: 6 | Wall Time: 0ms │ Turn ┆ Role ┆ Tool Invocations ┆ Tokens (In / Write / Read / Out) │ │ 0 ┆ User ┆ - ┆ - │ │ 1 ┆ Assistant ┆ view_file(call_read_01) ┆ 12500/2500/45000/85 │ │ 2 ┆ ToolResult ┆ - ┆ - │ │ 3 ┆ Assistant ┆ replace_file_content(call_edit_01) ┆ 13200/0/47500/140 │ │ 4 ┆ ToolResult ┆ - ┆ - │ │ 5 ┆ Assistant ┆ - ┆ 13500/0/47500/45 │\"\n          - complementary\n        - region \"Micro-benchmarks\" [ref=f147e217]:\n          - generic [ref=f147e218]:\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e219]: \"{\"\n            - generic [ref=f147e220]: measured\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e221]: \"}\"\n          - heading \"Micro-benchmarks\" [level=2] [ref=f147e222]\n          - paragraph [ref=f147e223]: Criterion on an Apple M3 Pro. Ingestion speed on large files hasn’t been measured.\n          - generic [ref=f147e226]:\n            - generic [ref=f147e227]:\n              - definition [ref=f147e228]: 82–229 ns\n              - term [ref=f147e229]: Detect which agent wrote a log\n              - definition [ref=f147e230]: Short fixture files for Antigravity, OpenCode and Claude Code. Codex isn’t in the benchmark.\n            - generic [ref=f147e231]:\n              - definition [ref=f147e232]: 1.16 ms\n              - term [ref=f147e233]: One analysis pass over 10,000 turns\n              - definition [ref=f147e234]: Synthetic turns with one file read each, 19 accumulators.\n            - generic [ref=f147e235]:\n              - definition [ref=f147e236]: 10.7 µs\n              - term [ref=f147e237]: Loop detection on a 500-node graph\n              - definition [ref=f147e238]: Synthetic graph with planted loops.\n          - complementary\n        - region \"Before you try it\" [ref=f147e239]:\n          - generic [ref=f147e240]:\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e241]: \"{\"\n            - generic [ref=f147e242]: limits\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e243]: \"}\"\n          - heading \"Before you try it\" [level=2] [ref=f147e244]\n          - list [ref=f147e246]:\n            - listitem [ref=f147e247]: Not on crates.io and no release binaries. Build it from source.\n            - listitem [ref=f147e248]: The lumen-cli crate on crates.io is a different project.\n            - listitem [ref=f147e249]: Runs after the session. No live monitoring, daemon or agent hooks.\n            - listitem [ref=f147e250]: \"Codex logs give session totals only: no per-turn cost and no loop detection.\"\n            - listitem [ref=f147e251]: Antigravity logs carry no token counts, so cost reads unknown.\n            - listitem [ref=f147e252]: lumen ingest reads one directory level. Codex’s dated folders go in a day at a time.\n            - listitem [ref=f147e253]: The CLI shows cost, cache, loops and review stalls. Latency, retries and the rest need the Rust library.\n            - listitem [ref=f147e254]: Historical price changes aren’t modelled yet.\n        - region \"What it reports\" [ref=f147e255]:\n          - generic [ref=f147e256]:\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e257]: \"{\"\n            - generic [ref=f147e258]: features\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e259]: \"}\"\n          - heading \"What it reports\" [level=2] [ref=f147e260]\n          - generic [ref=f147e262]:\n            - region \"Cost and cache\" [ref=f147e263]:\n              - heading \"Cost and cache\" [level=3] [ref=f147e264]\n              - list [ref=f147e265]:\n                - listitem [ref=f147e266]: \"Tokens by tier: uncached input, 5-minute and 1-hour cache writes, cache reads, output.\"\n                - listitem [ref=f147e267]: \"Cache hit ratio: cache reads over all input tokens.\"\n                - listitem [ref=f147e268]: Cost priced per turn, at that turn’s timestamp.\n                - listitem [ref=f147e269]: An unpriced model reads “unknown”, never $0.00.\n                - listitem [ref=f147e270]: Subagent spend rolls up into the parent session.\n                - listitem [ref=f147e271]: Compacted sessions are counted once, not twice.\n            - region \"Loops\" [ref=f147e272]:\n              - heading \"Loops\" [level=3] [ref=f147e273]\n              - list [ref=f147e274]:\n                - listitem [ref=f147e275]: Tool calls become a graph. Cycles are found with Tarjan’s algorithm.\n                - listitem [ref=f147e276]: \"A circular loop: three or more steps around the same symbol with no edit.\"\n                - listitem [ref=f147e277]: \"A review stall: a drafter and auditor past two rounds.\"\n            - region \"How to read the numbers\" [ref=f147e278]:\n              - heading \"How to read the numbers\" [level=3] [ref=f147e279]\n              - list [ref=f147e280]:\n                - listitem [ref=f147e281]: \"Observed: token counts as the agent logged them.\"\n                - listitem [ref=f147e282]: \"Derived: cost and cache hit ratio, calculated from observed tokens and a versioned price table.\"\n                - listitem [ref=f147e283]: \"Modelled: the no-cache baseline, savings and multiplier. What the session would have cost without caching, not a saving anyone recorded.\"\n            - region \"Commands, all local\" [ref=f147e284]:\n              - heading \"Commands, all local\" [level=3] [ref=f147e285]\n              - list [ref=f147e286]:\n                - listitem [ref=f147e287]: lumen audit and lumen trace read one file and write nothing.\n                - listitem [ref=f147e288]: lumen ingest stores sessions in a local SQLite file.\n                - listitem [ref=f147e289]: lumen sessions and lumen session read them back.\n                - listitem [ref=f147e290]: lumen trends compares cost, cache and loops across sessions.\n                - listitem [ref=f147e291]: \"--json on every command.\"\n                - listitem [ref=f147e292]: No network client. Prices ship with the binary.\n        - region \"What it supports\" [ref=f147e293]:\n          - generic [ref=f147e294]:\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e295]: \"{\"\n            - generic [ref=f147e296]: support\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e297]: \"}\"\n          - heading \"What it supports\" [level=2] [ref=f147e298]\n          - generic [ref=f147e301]:\n            - heading \"Which agents it reads\" [level=3] [ref=f147e302]\n            - paragraph [ref=f147e303]: Lumen reports what each agent logs. Some log less.\n            - region \"Agents\" [ref=f147e304]:\n              - table \"Agents\" [ref=f147e305]:\n                - caption [ref=f147e306]: Agents\n                - rowgroup [ref=f147e307]:\n                  - row [ref=f147e308]:\n                    - columnheader \"agent\" [ref=f147e309]\n                    - columnheader \"tool calls\" [ref=f147e310]\n                    - columnheader \"tokens\" [ref=f147e311]\n                    - columnheader \"cost\" [ref=f147e312]\n                - rowgroup [ref=f147e313]:\n                  - row [ref=f147e314]:\n                    - rowheader \"Claude Code\" [ref=f147e315]\n                    - 'cell \"In the logs: Yes, with subagents and compaction\" [ref=f147e316]':\n                      - generic [ref=f147e319]:\n                        - generic [ref=f147e320]: \"In the logs:\"\n                        - text: Yes, with subagents and compaction\n                    - 'cell \"In the logs: Per turn, every cache tier\" [ref=f147e321]':\n                      - generic [ref=f147e324]:\n                        - generic [ref=f147e325]: \"In the logs:\"\n                        - text: Per turn, every cache tier\n                    - 'cell \"In the logs: Per turn\" [ref=f147e326]':\n                      - generic [ref=f147e329]:\n                        - generic [ref=f147e330]: \"In the logs:\"\n                        - text: Per turn\n                  - row [ref=f147e331]:\n                    - rowheader \"OpenCode\" [ref=f147e332]\n                    - 'cell \"In the logs: Yes\" [ref=f147e333]':\n                      - generic [ref=f147e336]:\n                        - generic [ref=f147e337]: \"In the logs:\"\n                        - text: \"Yes\"\n                    - 'cell \"Partly, or coarser: Per message, no 1-hour cache split\" [ref=f147e338]':\n                      - generic [ref=f147e341]:\n                        - generic [ref=f147e342]: \"Partly, or coarser:\"\n                        - text: Per message, no 1-hour cache split\n                    - 'cell \"In the logs: Per message\" [ref=f147e343]':\n                      - generic [ref=f147e346]:\n                        - generic [ref=f147e347]: \"In the logs:\"\n                        - text: Per message\n                  - row [ref=f147e348]:\n                    - rowheader \"Codex\" [ref=f147e349]\n                    - 'cell \"Not in the logs: No\" [ref=f147e350]':\n                      - generic [ref=f147e353]:\n                        - generic [ref=f147e354]: \"Not in the logs:\"\n                        - text: \"No\"\n                    - 'cell \"Partly, or coarser: Session totals only\" [ref=f147e355]':\n                      - generic [ref=f147e358]:\n                        - generic [ref=f147e359]: \"Partly, or coarser:\"\n                        - text: Session totals only\n                    - 'cell \"Partly, or coarser: Per session\" [ref=f147e360]':\n                      - generic [ref=f147e363]:\n                        - generic [ref=f147e364]: \"Partly, or coarser:\"\n                        - text: Per session\n                  - row [ref=f147e365]:\n                    - rowheader \"Antigravity\" [ref=f147e366]\n                    - 'cell \"In the logs: Yes\" [ref=f147e367]':\n                      - generic [ref=f147e370]:\n                        - generic [ref=f147e371]: \"In the logs:\"\n                        - text: \"Yes\"\n                    - 'cell \"Not in the logs: None in the logs\" [ref=f147e372]':\n                      - generic [ref=f147e375]:\n                        - generic [ref=f147e376]: \"Not in the logs:\"\n                        - text: None in the logs\n                    - 'cell \"Not in the logs: Unknown\" [ref=f147e377]':\n                      - generic [ref=f147e380]:\n                        - generic [ref=f147e381]: \"Not in the logs:\"\n                        - text: Unknown\n            - list \"Key\" [ref=f147e382]:\n              - listitem [ref=f147e383]: In the logs\n              - listitem [ref=f147e385]: Partly, or coarser\n              - listitem [ref=f147e387]: Not in the logs\n        - region \"Inside Orin DX\" [ref=f147e389]:\n          - generic [ref=f147e390]:\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e391]: \"{\"\n            - generic [ref=f147e392]: the family\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e393]: \"}\"\n          - heading \"Inside Orin DX\" [level=2] [ref=f147e394]\n          - generic [ref=f147e396]:\n            - generic [ref=f147e397]: lumen\n            - list \"What lumen works with\" [ref=f147e411]:\n              - listitem [ref=f147e412]:\n                - generic [ref=f147e415]:\n                  - link \"prism\" [ref=f147e416] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /tools/prism/\n                  - generic [ref=f147e417]: Prism reads transcripts with Lumen’s parsers, so both count cost and cache the same way.\n              - listitem [ref=f147e418]:\n                - generic [ref=f147e421]:\n                  - link \"wisp\" [ref=f147e422] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /tools/wisp/\n                  - generic [ref=f147e423]: Telemetry from Wisp and Monokl, so context changes show up in the numbers. Planned.\n              - listitem [ref=f147e424]:\n                - generic [ref=f147e427]:\n                  - link \"michi\" [ref=f147e428] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: /tools/michi/\n                  - generic [ref=f147e429]: TOON output through Michi. Planned.\n        - region \"What’s next\" [ref=f147e430]:\n          - generic [ref=f147e431]:\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e432]: \"{\"\n            - generic [ref=f147e433]: next\n            - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=f147e434]: \"}\"\n          - heading \"What’s next\" [level=2] [ref=f147e435]\n          - list [ref=f147e437]:\n            - listitem [ref=f147e438]: \"A measurement basis on every figure in the output: observed, derived or modelled.\"\n            - listitem [ref=f147e439]: \"More agents: older OpenCode storage and Gemini-style logs such as Qwen Code.\"\n            - listitem [ref=f147e440]: Telemetry from Wisp and Monokl, so context changes show up in the numbers.\n            - listitem [ref=f147e441]: Sessions handed to Prism as regression tasks.\n            - listitem [ref=f147e442]: Workflow classification and missed-savings insights.\n    - navigation \"Previous and next tool\" [ref=f147e445]:\n      - list [ref=f147e446]:\n        - listitem [ref=f147e447]:\n          - link \"previous caliper build · pre-release\" [ref=f147e448] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: /tools/caliper/\n            - generic [ref