{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"4c72440d-a6e2-4bf8-9c73-6f5da1acdec2","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytvm9bSaU8ytttXFcEw","lastSequenceNum":487,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"1ea5e0ef-d430-4e9a-9b49-0088c3aba57c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgv457BLMY9pGpGzFabkn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":339,"cache_read_input_tokens":694545,"output_tokens":1062,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":199},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":339,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1062,"cache_read_input_tokens":694545,"cache_creation_input_tokens":339,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":339},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":6326,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"7f59a127-2627-4076-a9a4-931006bf3d76","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cgv456nmGZGFSYctLtP81","requestRef":"9a24422f-64df-4830-a722-68ea935e2e52","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"bb46b3bf-4b18-4b52-a71d-7edb80f1c0bb","timestamp":"2026-11-10T22:41:45.553Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"4c72440d-a6e2-4bf8-9c73-6f5da1acdec2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","sessionId":"4c72440d-a6e2-4bf8-9c73-6f5da1acdec2","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"main","slug":"frolicking-percolating-waffle"}
{"parentUuid":"bb46b3bf-4b18-4b52-a71d-7edb80f1c0bb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgv457BLMY9pGpGzFabkn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You were right, and the cause was a missing token, not a one-off. The open breadcrumb menu on the lumen page now sits above the chapter list, and its \"all tools\" entry is no longer cut off. I opened it on the lumen page at desktop width in light theme to check.\n\n**What was wrong:** the system has semantic z-index tokens (`popup` 30, `overlay` 20, `toggle.raised` 1, `sheet.header` 1). But the chapter list used a literal `1`, and the breadcrumb trail borrowed `toggle.raised`, which is also `1`. With equal values the later element paints on top, so the list covered the trail's open menu.\n\n**The fix:** I added two roles to both brands' `tokens.json`, each with a usage note. I pointed the two components at them.\n- `zIndex.rail` (1): the chapter list. Used by `chapterNavRecipe.ts` instead of the literal.\n- `zIndex.trail` (2): the breadcrumb trail, one step above so a menu opened from it covers the list. Used by `toolBreadcrumbPlacement.ts` instead of the Toggle's token.\n\n**Checks, all exit 0:**\n- **Brand package:** vitest (57 tests), oxlint and oxfmt.\n- **foundations:** typecheck, lint and test (there's no build task).\n- **orin:** build and test.\n- **orin-dx:** format, typecheck, lint, test, build and verify.\n- **Shared recipe on other sites:** techworx typecheck, build and verify; orin-dx-docs typecheck and build.\n\n**Left alone, but worth a decision:** the site nav still uses literal `10` and `11` in `siteNavParts.ts`, and several decorative layers use literal `-1`. They don't conflict today, but they're the same gap. A `nav` role (10) would be the natural next token. I didn't add it, since nothing is broken there.\n\n**Not checked:** I didn't open the switcher on the other tool pages or on the Caliper evidence pages (the trail class is shared, so they should match), or at phone width.\n\nNothing is committed in the pages repo. It now holds the DocumentPage conversion, the shared data module, the hero and table components, the lattice level and these tokens. Shall I commit this on a branch, split into logical commits?\n\nresult: The breadcrumb menu now opens above the chapter list, via new semantic `zIndex.rail` (1) and `zIndex.trail` (2) tokens in both brands, with brand, foundations, orin, orin-dx, techworx and docs checks all exit 0, uncommitted in `~/projects/pages`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":339,"cache_read_input_tokens":694545,"output_tokens":1062,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":199},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":339,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1062,"cache_read_input_tokens":694545,"cache_creation_input_tokens":339,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":339},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7f59a127-2627-4076-a9a4-931006bf3d76","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgv456nmGZGFSYctLtP81","requestRef":"9a24422f-64df-4830-a722-68ea935e2e52","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"72440204-4fbc-4619-8a0c-e145b0594ad4","timestamp":"2026-11-10T22:41:46.302Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"4c72440d-a6e2-4bf8-9c73-6f5da1acdec2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","sessionId":"4c72440d-a6e2-4bf8-9c73-6f5da1acdec2","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"main","slug":"frolicking-percolating-waffle"}
