{"parentUuid":"17197f6b-af27-423c-baf4-f7ce6136218b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgvYAiBu2qU5UoeWkZTsJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Checking against the current `origin/main` docs, the answer is no. Here is where the lessons stand, and I'm also saving the main working-style correction to memory."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3541,"cache_read_input_tokens":696045,"output_tokens":2427,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1452},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3541,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2427,"cache_read_input_tokens":696045,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3541,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3541},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"81c04969-e391-4dd9-b546-6f41a304b064","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgvYAhk7cuuihyQH8eSVb","requestRef":"4eee1935-9e63-4671-ba6a-38ac40f71550","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c9c15401-996a-4a1f-bca4-bf90a7e4ae23","timestamp":"2026-11-11T04:50:17.968Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"4c72440d-a6e2-4bf8-9c73-6f5da1acdec2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","sessionId":"4c72440d-a6e2-4bf8-9c73-6f5da1acdec2","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"main","slug":"frolicking-percolating-waffle"}
{"parentUuid":"c9c15401-996a-4a1f-bca4-bf90a7e4ae23","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgvYAiBu2qU5UoeWkZTsJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UHLgSABvStR3CbqBjHBNqP","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/projects/-Users-gabe-Projects-caliper/memory/use-existing-components-and-tokens.md","content":"---\nname: use-existing-components-and-tokens\ndescription: On the Orin DX pages repo, find and reuse the system's component, recipe or token before building anything; read the layout and opener rules first\nmetadata:\n  type: feedback\n---\n\nOn `~/projects/pages` (orin-dx site, `packages/orin`, `packages/foundations`): look for the existing component, recipe, slot or token first, and read the system's own rules before composing a layout.\n\n**Why:** across the evidence-page work I repeatedly invented things (a hand-built hero header, local card styles in a 2×2 grid, ad-hoc `lx-page` classes, a bare lattice with no star, a borrowed `toggle.raised` z-index) and the user rejected each one (\"WTF are you inventing new things\", \"use what we have\"). The fix each time was an existing piece: `ToolHero` and `DocumentPage` for openers and the chapter list, `TypeBoundaries` for code plus result, `ComparisonBars` for charts, `ItemGroups`, and role tokens in `packages/brand/*/project/tokens.json`.\n\n**How to apply:**\n- Before building: grep `packages/orin/src`, `apps/orin-dx/src/components`, and the opener/layout docs (`docs/plans/page-layouts.md`, `packages/orin/src/opener/openerAnatomy.ts`, `docs/design-system-rules.md`: composition over configuration).\n- Prefer composition (slots, ReactNode props) to enum or boolean config flags; add an optional data prop to an existing component only when composition is impossible (`.astro` cannot pass styled React nodes).\n- Layers get semantic role tokens in both brands' tokens.json (`zIndex.popup`, `.overlay`, `.rail`, `.trail`), never literals or another component's token.\n- Verify with Playwright screenshots (desktop and phone) and run `orin-dx` format, typecheck, lint, test, build and verify; moon needs the sandbox off.\n- Judge numbers by correctness against the checker and state the counting unit, denominators and scope of each tool before presenting a comparison; see [[type-correctness-over-rdt-parity]].\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3541,"cache_read_input_tokens":696045,"output_tokens":2427,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1452},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3541,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2427,"cache_read_input_tokens":696045,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3541,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3541},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01UHLgSABvStR3CbqBjHBNqP":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/projects/-Users-gabe-Projects-caliper/memory/use-existing-components-and-tokens.md","content":"---\nname: use-existing-components-and-tokens\ndescription: On the Orin DX pages repo, find and reuse the system's component, recipe or token before building anything; read the layout and opener rules first\nmetadata:\n  type: feedback\n---\n\nOn `~/projects/pages` (orin-dx site, `packages/orin`, `packages/foundations`): look for the existing component, recipe, slot or token first, and read the system's own rules before composing a layout.\n\n**Why:** across the evidence-page work I repeatedly invented things (a hand-built hero header, local card styles in a 2×2 grid, ad-hoc `lx-page` classes, a bare lattice with no star, a borrowed `toggle.raised` z-index) and the user rejected each one (\"WTF are you inventing new things\", \"use what we have\"). The fix each time was an existing piece: `ToolHero` and `DocumentPage` for openers and the chapter list, `TypeBoundaries` for code plus result, `ComparisonBars` for charts, `ItemGroups`, and role tokens in `packages/brand/*/project/tokens.json`.\n\n**How to apply:**\n- Before building: grep `packages/orin/src`, `apps/orin-dx/src/components`, and the opener/layout docs (`docs/plans/page-layouts.md`, `packages/orin/src/opener/openerAnatomy.ts`, `docs/design-system-rules.md`: composition over configuration).\n- Prefer composition (slots, ReactNode props) to enum or boolean config flags; add an optional data prop to an existing component only when composition is impossible (`.astro` cannot pass styled React nodes).\n- Layers get semantic role tokens in both brands' tokens.json (`zIndex.popup`, `.overlay`, `.rail`, `.trail`), never literals or another component's token.\n- Verify with Playwright screenshots (desktop and phone) and run `orin-dx` format, typecheck, lint, test, build and verify; moon needs the sandbox off.\n- Judge numbers by correctness against the checker and state the counting unit, denominators and scope of each tool before presenting a comparison; see [[type-correctness-over-rdt-parity]].\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"81c04969-e391-4dd9-b546-6f41a304b064","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgvYAhk7cuuihyQH8eSVb","requestRef":"4eee1935-9e63-4671-ba6a-38ac40f71550","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c5aa71c1-a046-4b88-a6f6-75b8bd2820d9","timestamp":"2026-11-11T04:50:23.850Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"4c72440d-a6e2-4bf8-9c73-6f5da1acdec2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","sessionId":"4c72440d-a6e2-4bf8-9c73-6f5da1acdec2","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"main","slug":"frolicking-percolating-waffle"}
{"parentUuid":"c5aa71c1-a046-4b88-a6f6-75b8bd2820d9","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"911f03b1-a511-4bc4-afa6-255cd7ac70fe","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UHLgSABvStR3CbqBjHBNqP","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/gabe/.claude/projects/-Users-gabe-Projects-caliper/memory/use-existing-components-and-tokens.md"}]},"uuid":"8401d230-1de8-46d7-ba2e-9e9c9e9dc3da","timestamp":"2026-11-11T04:50:24.002Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/gabe/.claude/projects/-Users-gabe-Projects-caliper/memory/use-existing-components-and-tokens.md","content":"---\nname: use-existing-components-and-tokens\ndescription: \"On the Orin DX pages repo, find and reuse the system's component, recipe or token before building anything; read the layout and opener rules first\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: feedback\n  originSessionId: 4c72440d-a6e2-4bf8-9c73-6f5da1acdec2\n  modified: 2026-11-11T04:50:23.958Z\n---\n\nOn `~/projects/pages` (orin-dx site, `packages/orin`, `packages/foundations`): look for the existing component, recipe, slot or token first, and read the system's own rules before composing a layout.\n\n**Why:** across the evidence-page work I repeatedly invented things (a hand-built hero header, local card styles in a 2×2 grid, ad-hoc `lx-page` classes, a bare lattice with no star, a borrowed `toggle.raised` z-index) and the user rejected each one (\"WTF are you inventing new things\", \"use what we have\"). The fix each time was an existing piece: `ToolHero` and `DocumentPage` for openers and the chapter list, `TypeBoundaries` for code plus result, `ComparisonBars` for charts, `ItemGroups`, and role tokens in `packages/brand/*/project/tokens.json`.\n\n**How to apply:**\n- Before building: grep `packages/orin/src`, `apps/orin-dx/src/components`, and the opener/layout docs (`docs/plans/page-layouts.md`, `packages/orin/src/opener/openerAnatomy.ts`, `docs/design-system-rules.md`: composition over configuration).\n- Prefer composition (slots, ReactNode props) to enum or boolean config flags; add an optional data prop to an existing component only when composition is impossible (`.astro` cannot pass styled React nodes).\n- Layers get semantic role tokens in both brands' tokens.json (`zIndex.popup`, `.overlay`, `.rail`, `.trail`), never literals or another component's token.\n- Verify with Playwright screenshots (desktop and phone) and run `orin-dx` format, typecheck, lint, test, build and verify; moon needs the sandbox off.\n- Judge numbers by correctness against the checker and state the counting unit, denominators and scope of each tool before presenting a comparison; see [[type-correctness-over-rdt-parity]].\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false,"memdirStamped":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c5aa71c1-a046-4b88-a6f6-75b8bd2820d9","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"other"},"session_id":"4c72440d-a6e2-4bf8-9c73-6f5da1acdec2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","sessionId":"4c72440d-a6e2-4bf8-9c73-6f5da1acdec2","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"main","slug":"frolicking-percolating-waffle"}
