{"parentUuid":"e32a816e-623d-4cd7-a8e9-dd4f9ef2d9c8","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"59b8b9da-3745-4467-ad83-b44577dbb5ac","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AiuKtkNYfb5TW37GFdTbm4","type":"tool_result","content":"# Design system API reference\n\nReference for the five design-system packages in this workspace: the exports map of each, then for each exported component its props, slots, emitted attributes and accessibility behaviour. Everything is derived from `package.json`, the TypeScript source, the slot recipes and the tests beside them.\n\nThe reference is structured per package and per component so a section can be regenerated when its source changes. To regenerate a component section, read its `.tsx` file for the props type, its `*Recipe.ts` (or the package's `recipes.ts`) for slots, variants and default variants, and its tests for what is asserted. Generated output (`styled-system`, `dist/panda`) is gitignored; read recipe definitions, not generated files.\n\n## Contents\n\n- `@pages/foundations`: Panda presets, tokens, the layout frame and slot helpers\n- `@pages/components`: shared components and helpers\n- `@pages/twx`: techworx components\n- `@pages/orin`: Orin DX components\n- `@pages/cv-kit`: the CV page shell\n- Usage inventory\n730:### Frame layout: `Block` and `DocumentPage`\ncheckBuiltSite.mjs  7.3K\noxlintPanda.mjs  1.4K\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"118571cb-35f8-4471-89c8-8fbcde40d5b9","timestamp":"2026-11-11T17:52:43.827Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"# Design system API reference\n\nReference for the five design-system packages in this workspace: the exports map of each, then for each exported component its props, slots, emitted attributes and accessibility behaviour. Everything is derived from `package.json`, the TypeScript source, the slot recipes and the tests beside them.\n\nThe reference is structured per package and per component so a section can be regenerated when its source changes. To regenerate a component section, read its `.tsx` file for the props type, its `*Recipe.ts` (or the package's `recipes.ts`) for slots, variants and default variants, and its tests for what is asserted. Generated output (`styled-system`, `dist/panda`) is gitignored; read recipe definitions, not generated files.\n\n## Contents\n\n- `@pages/foundations`: Panda presets, tokens, the layout frame and slot helpers\n- `@pages/components`: shared components and helpers\n- `@pages/twx`: techworx components\n- `@pages/orin`: Orin DX components\n- `@pages/cv-kit`: the CV page shell\n- Usage inventory\n730:### Frame layout: `Block` and `DocumentPage`\ncheckBuiltSite.mjs  7.3K\noxlintPanda.mjs  1.4K","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"classifierBoundary":true,"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"bdd5158a-ab00-492f-9390-2278fc5e7d4f","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxViolations":[],"sandboxed":true,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e32a816e-623d-4cd7-a8e9-dd4f9ef2d9c8","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"4c72440d-a6e2-4bf8-9c73-6f5da1acdec2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","sessionId":"4c72440d-a6e2-4bf8-9c73-6f5da1acdec2","ver