{"parentUuid":"f8ab242c-0531-4748-8ed7-1139c0779ff6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PreToolUse:Bash","toolUseID":"toolu_01Dj3xnvWvirKnj1WeTStypy","hookEvent":"PreToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"PreToolUse\",\"permissionDecisionReason\":\"RTK auto-rewrite\",\"updatedInput\":{\"command\":\"cd /Users/gabe/projects/pages && sed -n 3521,3545p docs/design-system-api.md; echo \\\"-------TOOLHERO\\\"; sed -n 3651,3690p docs/design-system-api.md; echo \\\"-------TABLE\\\"; rtk grep -n \\\"^#### Table\\\\|#### Table\\\" docs/design-system-api.md; rtk grep -n \\\"\\\\`Table\\\\`\\\" docs/design-system-api.md | head -5\",\"description\":\"Read the Lattice and ToolHero reference sections and locate Table\"}}}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"rtk hook claude","durationMs":21},"type":"attachment","uuid":"e8b82966-101f-4682-bb07-427f6ac58d63","timestamp":"2026-11-11T17:52:51.797Z","session_id":"4c72440d-a6e2-4bf8-9c73-6f5da1acdec2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","sessionId":"4c72440d-a6e2-4bf8-9c73-6f5da1acdec2","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"main","slug":"frolicking-percolating-waffle"}
{"parentUuid":"f8ab242c-0531-4748-8ed7-1139c0779ff6","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"59b8b9da-3745-4467-ad83-b44577dbb5ac","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Dj3xnvWvirKnj1WeTStypy","type":"tool_result","content":"#### Lattice\n\n- Import: `import { Lattice } from '@pages/orin/Lattice'` (also exports type `LatticeProps`)\n- Source: `packages/orin/src/lattice/lattice.tsx`; recipe: `latticeRecipe` in `packages/orin/src/lattice/latticeRecipe.ts`.\n- Tests: none.\n- What it renders: a decorative `<div>` that paints a masked hexagonal field.\n- Usage: in use (through Hero, ToolHero). Consumers in apps: none. Composed inside: Hero, ToolHero.\n\n**Props**\n\n| Prop | Type | Default | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `full` | `boolean` | none | Removes the radial fade mask so the hexagons cover the whole box. |\n| `soft` | `boolean` | none | A fade that reaches nothing on every side, centred on `--lattice-x`, for a field with no card edge to end it (PageIntro). |\n| `classes` | `{ root? }` (string) | none | Appended by `mergeSlots`. |\n| `...rest` | `ComponentPropsWithRef<'div'>` minus `children`, `className` | none | Spread onto the root `<div>`. |\n\n**Slots**\n\n| Slot | Element / purpose |\n| --- | --- |\n| `root` | `<div>`, `data-slot=\"root\"`; `position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.2`; background is `var(--tint, var(--colors-text-accent))`. The parent supplies positioning and optionally `--tint`. |\n\n**Variants**\n\n-------TOOLHERO\n#### ToolHero\n\n- Import: `import { ToolHero } from '@pages/orin/ToolHero'` (also exports type `ToolHeroProps`)\n- Source: `packages/orin/src/tool-hero/toolHero.tsx`; recipe: `toolHeroRecipe` in `packages/orin/src/tool-hero/toolHeroRecipe.ts`. Renders `Lattice`, `FamilyChip` and `ToolMark`.\n- Tests: none.\n- What it renders: a `<section aria-label={name}>` with a tinted lattice, a hero mark, a family chip, a heading, a `{ orin dx }` byline, a description, a stage and optional actions.\n- Usage: in use. Consumers in apps: orin-dx: toolPageHero.\n\n**Props**\n\n| Prop | Type | Default | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `family` | `'know' \\| 'build' \\| 'measure' \\| 'ship'` | required | Sets the `--tint` colour on the root and the family chip. |\n| `tool` | `ToolName` | required | Selects the default mark. |\n| `name` | `string` | required | Heading text and the section's `aria-label`. |\n| `description` | `ReactNode` | required | Rendered in a `<p>`. |\n| `mark` | `ReactNode` | `<ToolMark tool={tool} size=\"fluid\" treatment=\"hero\" />` | Replaces the default mark. |\n| `stage` | `ReactNode` | required | Rendered in a `<div>`; the caller supplies content (for example a `StageChip`). |\n| `actions` | `ReactNode` | none | Rendered in a flex row when truthy. |\n| `headingAs` | `'h1' \\| 'h2'` | `'h1'` | Heading element. |\n| `classes` | `{ root?, inner?, mark?, content?, family?, title?, byline?, brace?, description?, stage?, actions? }` (strings) | none | Appended per slot by `mergeSlots`. |\n| `...rest` | `ComponentPropsWithRef<'section'>` minus `children`, `className` | none | Spread onto the root `<section>`. |\n\n**Slots**\n\n| Slot          | Element / purpose                                                                        |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `root`        | `<section>`, `data-slot=\"root\"`; `container-type: inline-size`.                          |\n| `inner`       | `<div>` two-column grid, `data-slot=\"inner\"`; one column at container width up to 700px. |\n| `mark`        | `<div aria-hidden=\"true\">`, `data-slot=\"mark\"`.                                          |\n| `content`     | `<div>`, `data-slot=\"content\"`.                                                          |\n| `family`      | `<div>` wrapping the family chip, `data-slot=\"family\"`.                                  |\n| `title`       | Heading element, `data-slot=\"title\"`.                                                    |\n| `byline`      | `<div>`, `data-slot=\"byline\"`; holds the brace spans and `orin dx`.                      |\n| `brace`       | Two `<span>` elements holding `{` and `}`, each `data-slot=\"brace\"`; not `aria-hidden`.  |\n| `description` | `<p>`, `data-slot=\"description\"`.                                                        |\n| `stage`       | `<div>`, `data-slot=\"stage\"`.                                                            |\n| `actions`     | `<div>`, `data-slot=\"actions\"`; rendered when `actions` is truthy.                       |\n\nA `Lattice` (its own `data-recipe=\"lattice\"`) is the first child of the section.\n-------TABLE\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"2fb3f170-e420-497a-b6e2-8e24a9b04b14","timestamp":"2026-11-11T17:52:54.458Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"#### Lattice\n\n- Import: `import { Lattice } from '@pages/orin/Lattice'` (also exports type `LatticeProps`)\n- Source: `packages/orin/src/lattice/lattice.tsx`; recipe: `latticeRecipe` in `packages/orin/src/lattice/latticeRecipe.ts`.\n- Tests: none.\n- What it renders: a decorative `<div>` that paints a masked hexagonal field.\n- Usage: in use (through Hero, ToolHero). Consumers in apps: none. Composed inside: Hero, ToolHero.\n\n**Props**\n\n| Prop | Type | Default | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `full` | `boolean` | none | Removes the radial fade mask so the hexagons cover the whole box. |\n| `soft` | `boolean` | none | A fade that reaches nothing on every side, centred on `--lattice-x`, for a field with no card edge to end it (PageIntro). |\n| `classes` | `{ root? }` (string) | none | Appended by `mergeSlots`. |\n| `...rest` | `ComponentPropsWithRef<'div'>` minus `children`, `className` | none | Spread onto the root `<div>`. |\n\n**Slots**\n\n| Slot | Element / purpose |\n| --- | --- |\n| `root` | `<div>`, `data-slot=\"root\"`;