{"parentUuid":"d8f6a554-6c7e-4a04-acec-baec84b6b8b2","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"59b8b9da-3745-4467-ad83-b44577dbb5ac","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0146F92q5QuSacjahrKwn4PS","type":"tool_result","content":"| Variant | Values | Default |\n| ------- | ------ | ------- |\n| `full`  | `true` | none    |\n\n**Attributes emitted**\n\n| Attribute     | Value                                           | Element |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------- |\n| `data-recipe` | `lattice`                                       | root    |\n| `data-full`   | `true` when `full` is truthy, otherwise omitted | root    |\n| `data-slot`   | `root`                                          | root    |\n| `aria-hidden` | `true`                                          | root    |\n\n**Accessibility**:\n\n- Decorative and `aria-hidden=\"true\"`, with `pointer-events: none`. No test.\n\n----\nA `Lattice` (its own `data-recipe=\"lattice\"`) is the first child of the section.\n\n**Variants**\n\n| Variant | Values | Default |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `family` | `know`, `build`, `measure`, `ship` (each sets `--tint` to `var(--colors-family-<family>)` on the root) | none (the component requires `family`) |\n\n**Attributes emitted**\n\n| Attribute     | Value                                            | Element                 |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------- |\n| `data-recipe` | `tool-hero`                                      | root                    |\n| `data-family` | the family                                       | root                    |\n| `data-slot`   | slot name                                        | each slot element       |\n| `aria-label`  | `name` (set after `...rest`, so not overridable) | root                    |\n| `aria-hidden` | `true`                                           | mark container, lattice |\n\n**Accessibility**:\n\n- The section has `aria-label` equal to `name`, which makes it a named region. No test.\n- The heading is an `<h1>` by default and can be an `<h2>` when the page already has an `<h1>`. No test.\n- The mark container is `aria-hidden`; the family chip carries the family as text. No test.\n\n----PAGE-SECTION-END\n\n**Accessibility**:\n\n- The section is named by its `<h2>` through `aria-labelledby`, which makes it a region landmark. No test.\n- The label's braces are `aria-hidden` through `SectionLabel`. No test on this component.\n\n#### Ledger\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"56e0815e-394b-44cc-b14d-eb6a86b5a40b","timestamp":"2026-11-11T17:53:04.602Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"| Variant | Values | Default |\n| ------- | ------ | ------- |\n| `full`  | `true` | none    |\n\n**Attributes emitted**\n\n| Attribute     | Value                                           | Element |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------- |\n| `data-recipe` | `lattice`                                       | root    |\n| `data-full`   | `true` when `full` is truthy, otherwise omitted | root    |\n| `data-slot`   | `root`                                          | root    |\n| `aria-hidden` | `true`                                          | root    |\n\n**Accessibility**:\n\n- Decorative and `aria-hidden=\"true\"`, with `pointer-events: none`. No test.\n\n----\nA `Lattice` (its own `data-recipe=\"lattice\"`) is the first child of the section.\n\n**Variants**\n\n| Variant | Values | Default |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `family` | `know`, `build`, `measure`, `ship` (each sets `--tint` to `var(--colors-family-<family>)` on the root) | none (the component requires `family`) |\n\n**Attributes emitted**\n\n| Attribute     | Value                                            | Element                 |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------- |\n| `data-recipe` | `tool-hero`                                      | root                    |\n| `data-family` | the family                                       | root                    |\n| `data-slot`   | slot name                                        | each slot element       |\n| `aria-label`  | `name` (set after `...rest`, so not overridable) | root                    |\n| `aria-hidden` | `true`                                           | mark container, lattice |\n\n**Accessibility**:\n\n- The section has `aria-label` equal to `name`, which makes it a named region. No test.\n- The heading is an `<h1>` by default and can be an `<h2>` when the page already has an `<h1>`. No test.\n- The mark container is `aria-hidden`; the family chip carries the family as text. No test.\n\n----PAGE-SECTION-END\n\n**Accessibility**:\n\n- The section is named by its `<h2>` through `aria-labelledby`, which makes it a region landmark. No test.\n- The label's braces are `aria-hidden` through `SectionLabel`. No test on this component.\n\n#### Ledger","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"ba21f3b7-e86b-4e15-b714-e69015b2e029","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxViolations":[],"sandboxed":true,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d8f6a554-6c7e-4a04-acec-baec84b6b8b2","permissionDe