ing-waffle"}
{"parentUuid":"967746ca-2eed-4bc3-91a5-bc41f4bd8704","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"59b8b9da-3745-4467-ad83-b44577dbb5ac","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LVp7rYu7Bz4zoysi4bhmCp","type":"tool_result","content":"<system-reminder>This memory is 20 days old. Memories are point-in-time observations, not live state — claims about code behavior or file:line citations may be outdated. Verify against current code before asserting as fact.</system-reminder>\n1\t---\n2\tname: sandbox-git-and-gh\n3\tdescription: \"In the caliper worktree sandbox, gh needs the sandbox off (TLS keychain) and git commits/config writes fail inside it\"\n4\tmetadata:\n5\t  node_type: memory\n6\t  type: reference\n7\t  originSessionId: ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675\n8\t  modified: 2026-10-21T23:23:15.348Z\n9\t---\n10\t\n11\t- `gh` fails inside the sandbox with `x509: OSStatus -26276` (macOS trust store); run it with the sandbox disabled.\n12\t- `git commit`/`cherry-pick --continue` fail with \"failed to write commit object\" inside the sandbox; `git checkout -B ... origin/x` fails writing tracking config — use `--no-track`, and commit with the sandbox disabled.\n13\t- The worktree guard refuses compound shell lines that run git; use `/usr/bin/git` with one plain command per call, and put multi-step logic in a Python script.\n14\t"}]},"uuid":"46b50def-7003-4d35-8ef8-f260b53d26d7","timestamp":"2026-11-11T17:54:55.193Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/.claude/projects/-Users-gabe-Projects-caliper/memory/sandbox-git-and-gh.md","content":"---\nname: sandbox-git-and-gh\ndescription: \"In the caliper worktree sandbox, gh needs the sandbox off (TLS keychain) and git commits/config writes fail inside it\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: reference\n  originSessionId: ba6a68d6-c702-4382-ab2f-60cd0f6af675\n  modified: 2026-10-21T23:23:15.348Z\n---\n\n- `gh` fails inside the sandbox with `x509: OSStatus -26276` (macOS trust store); run it with the sandbox disabled.\n- `git commit`/`cherry-pick --continue` fail with \"failed to write commit object\" inside the sandbox; `git checkout -B ... origin/x` fails writing tracking config — use `--no-track`, and commit with the sandbox disabled.\n- The worktree guard refuses compound shell lines that run git; use `/usr/bin/git` with one plain command per call, and put multi-step logic in a Python script.\n","numLines":14,"startLine":1,"totalLines":14}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"967746ca-2eed-4bc3-91a5-bc41f4bd8704","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"other"},"session_id":"4c72440d-a6e2-4bf8-9c73-6f5da1acdec2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper","sessionId":"4c72440d-a6e2-4bf8-9c73-6f5da1acdec2","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"main","slug":"frolicking-percolating-waffle"}
